# YouTube on VPS (Contabo/Coolify) — REQUIRED setup
#
# Home cookies DO NOT work on VPS. You need bgutil PO tokens.
#
# === Option A: Built into backend Docker (automatic) ===
# Rebuild backend. Check logs for:
#   [start] bgutil PO token server is ready
# Health: bgutil_reachable: true (preferred)
# If bgutil_script_available is true but bgutil_script_runnable is false, rebuild — Node/canvas issue.
#
# === Option B: Docker Compose sidecar (MOST RELIABLE) ===
#
# Deploy backend/docker-compose.yml in Coolify as a Compose resource.
# It starts bgutil + backend together. Backend uses:
#   BGUTIL_POT_BASE_URL=http://bgutil:4416
#
# === Option C: Separate Coolify Docker Image service ===
#
# 1. New Resource → Docker Image
#    Image: brainicism/bgutil-ytdlp-pot-provider:1.3.2-node
#    Port: 4416 (internal only)
#    Name: bgutil
#
# 2. Backend env var:
#    BGUTIL_POT_BASE_URL=http://bgutil:4416
#
# 3. Rebuild backend, verify:
#    GET /api/health → bgutil_reachable: true
#    GET /api/health/youtube-test → success: true
#
# Do NOT mount cookies.txt for YouTube on VPS.
